vectors {e1, e2, e3} and eigenvalues {l1, l2, l3}.\\nTensor[{l1, l2, l3}, \
\\\"Random\\\"] creates a diffuison tensor with random orthogonal \
eigenvectors {e1, e2, e2} and eigenvalues {l1, l2, l3}.\\nTensor[{l1, l2, \
l3}, \\\"RandomZ\\\"] creates a diffuison tensor with random orthogonal \
eigenvectors {{1,0,0}, e2, e3} with random eigenvectors and eigenvalues {l1, \
l2, l3}.\\nTensor[{l1, l2, l3}, \\\"OrtRandom\\\"] creates a diffuison tensor \
with random orthogonal eigenvectors {{1,0,0},{0,1,0},{0,0,1}} and eigenvalues \
