voxsize, folder] exports tensor to {XX.dat, YY.dat, ZZ.dat, XY.dat, XZ.dat, \
YZ.dat} to the given folder and uses XX.dat as background and generates \
corresponding *dti files. \\nDTItoolExp[tensor, voxsize, folder, add] exports \
